# Runtime snapshot cache — plain JSON and the .gz stay local; the snapshot is
# committed as per-authority NDJSON in cache/snapshot/ (git delta-compresses
# sorted lines; it cannot delta-compress a gzip stream — see lib/ingest), and
# the .gz is published as a release asset by the refresh-data GitHub Action.
# changes.json has to ship with the snapshot: it records what the rebuild added
# and removed, and a removal cannot be recomputed from the snapshot afterwards.
cache/*
!cache/snapshot/
cache/snapshot/*.tmp
!cache/changes.json
# Every build's changes.json, appended — see lib/history.
!cache/history.ndjson
# The field-level quality profile of the published build. Committed because the
# gate compares against what was actually published, not against a local run.
!cache/quality.json

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local tooling
.claude/

# Xcode — per-user state and build output; the project and sources are committed
ios/**/xcuserdata/
ios/**/*.xcuserstate
ios/build/
DerivedData/
